flowchart LR
    Public[Public User] --> Home["/ route"]
    Public --> Register["/register"]
    Public --> Login["/login"]

    Login -->|valid credentials| Session[(Flask session: user_id, username)]
    Session --> Dashboard["/dashboard"]
    Session --> CreateJob["/jobs POST"]
    Session --> DeleteJob["/jobs/<job_id>/delete POST"]
    Session --> Upload["/upload/<job_id> POST"]
    Session --> Status["/candidate/<candidate_id>/status POST"]
    Session --> Report["/jobs/<job_id>/selected-report.pdf"]
    Session --> Logout["/logout clears session"]

    Dashboard --> JobOwner{job.user_id == session.user_id}
    CreateJob --> SaveJob[(jobs table)]
    DeleteJob --> JobOwner
    Upload --> JobOwner
    Report --> JobOwner
    Status --> CandidateOwner{candidate joined with job owned by session user}

    JobOwner -- Yes --> AllowJob[Allow view/delete/upload/report]
    JobOwner -- No --> DenyJob[Redirect or flash error]
    CandidateOwner -- Yes --> AllowStatus[Update status]
    CandidateOwner -- No --> DenyStatus[Reject candidate update]

    NoSession[No session on protected route] --> RedirectLogin[Redirect to /login]
